# An Honest Return
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
Did you get hurt today?
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
Only a scratch.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
You say that before you even look at the bandage.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
I thought worrying you would make things harder.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Guessing is harder. Let me know the person who comes home.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
You set your pack down between you instead of hiding it by the door.
